				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ. πυρός</span>”
				<i>maturing in two months,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>HP</u>
					8.4.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνοχαί</span>”
