					<u>POxy.</u>
					1032.22
				</span></i>
			
			<span class="entity">(ii A. D.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν δ. ἄρχειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					6.34.3
				</span></i>
			.</div>
